        "SRC-001898"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "2025 APR lists 32 single-unit building permits for Toll Brothers at South Main (B-MU25-0001 to -0026 and -0052 to -0057), issued 2025-08-20 (26), 2025-10-22 (1) and 2025-10-23 (5), including 4 moderate-income units, at 624-662 S Main St and 648-718 Ohlone St under parent APN 086-25-027.",
      "src": [
        "SRC-001128"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Developer page (Nov. 2026): three-story condos, 3 bed / 3 bath, Myra 1,565 sf from $1,199,995 and Sana / Sana Elite 1,695 sf from $1,314,995 / $1,364,995; quick move-in homes at 646, 658 and 660 S Main and 660 Ohlone listed from $1,099,000.",
      "src": [
        "SRC-003424"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "SF YIMBY (Jan. 2024): a June 2023 county assessment valued the property at about $4.4 million; earlier TTLC plans had nine three-story buildings with homes of 1,420 to 2,090 sq ft.",
